0.01: New app
0.02: Astronomy clock face: moon phase, dark/dusk times, night cloud forecast,
      ISS pass, weather fetch via Gadgetbridge (Astrospheric or Open-Meteo)
0.03: Long-press BTN1 (0.6s) opens the system launcher, short press still opens
      the AstroWatch menu
      Show app version in the menu title
      Provide FontVGA16 as an app file instead of declaring a module dependency
      that nothing satisfies (app install failed)
0.04: Navigation overhaul:
      - Swipe Right from main face opens AstroWatch settings menu (Screen 3)
      - Swipe Left from main face opens detailed hourly weather display (Screen 2)
      - Physical button (BTN1) opens Bangle.js system launcher from main face
      - Physical button (BTN1) returns to main face from settings menu or Screen 2
      - Wall-clock minute alignment via queueDraw
0.05: Standalone "Sync Phone GPS" in AstroWatch menu and Settings.
      Decoupled weather fetching from GPS acquisition to eliminate timeouts.
      App Loader diagnostics & configuration interface (interface.html).
      Astrospheric reliability via Cloudflare slimming proxy with multi-model
      cloud ensemble averaging (2s fetch speed over BLE).

